/home/sat/mcrl-v025-rank-ws/V025-PILOT-MIN-REPORT-2026-09-09.md:112:- **D-MIN-4 (internal inconsistency). `V_CA` is large and negative while `FULL` pooled EE is the highest of all arms.** Net `V_CA` is -1.365e11 bit-equivalents (bits -1.222e10, -eta*energy -3.373e10, Phi -9.054e10) against the additive selector, yet `FULL` pooled EE (3.425e7) exceeds `DROP_C3` (2.352e7), `S0` (1.759e7) and `BASELINE` (1.699e7). Either the `V_CA` reference (the additive selector) or the pooled-EE aggregation is not measuring what the schema intends. **This must be resolved before any V_CA number is reported at scale.**
