/home/sat/mcrl-v025-strategic-fable-ws/controller-records/V025-CONTROLLER-ERRATA-2026-09-10.md:25:**10. "The selector's preference for the all-user coalition is a scale bias."** The exact winner **is** the all-user coalition at 26 of 30 held-out anchors. The oracle picks it too. *Corrected by the parametrisation comparison.*
